### Crear token app (usuario MsMall)
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token_type": "app",
  "username": "admin@mall.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Crear service account exporter (admin con tokens:manage)
POST http://localhost:8000/service-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mall_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "local_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "token_type": "exporter",
  "scopes": ["export:write", "mapping:read"]
}

### Emitir token exporter
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token_type": "exporter",
  "client_id": "{{client_id}}",
  "client_secret": "{{client_secret}}"
}

### Usar endpoint protegido de sync (payload debe coincidir mall/local del token)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/exporter/sync/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{exporter_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mall_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "local_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "rows": []
}

### Ejecutar endpoint real de importación manual (exporter)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/remote/execute-manual/exporter
Authorization: Bearer {{exporter_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "filename": "ventas_2026-02-25.csv"
}

### Refresh (rotación obligatoria)
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{exporter_refresh_token}}"
}

### Revocar token actual
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{exporter_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "device_reprovisioned"
}
